From 4fd659975e1176fd247f295c3279ff857402d660 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tunkoal <tunkoal@163.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 18:35:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] apn: select a device source while retaining the common
 installer

Disabling the common APN prebuilt in 86e08fc removes duplicate install
recipes but fails the raw PRODUCT_PACKAGES existence check at
build/make/core/main.mk:1074 before installation overrides are applied.
Keep the public module name and sole Product installation instead.

Use the standard select source binding for lineage_apn.custom_apns;
unset retains :apns-conf. The prebuilt_etc installer consumes a supplied
source, whose validation is owned by its producer. The default generator
already mandates schema validation of inputs and final merged output in
make-apns.py:98-107,207,219, so the removed installer XML schema step was
redundant on that path. Retire the temporary use_device_apns switch.

Base: 2842825e44b5ad6e247467bd7a16c1d8bf80407f
Evidence: Rothko TELECOM_BROADNET_20261115.zh-CN.md, 18:21 retry failure
and package-existence follow-up. Device-only overriding cannot supply
the common module input without an owner hook in this pinned source.

Passed actual Soong fixtures for default input, qualified custom source,
Product installer location and rejection of undefined sources. Re-running
the default merge with mandatory schema checks produced byte-identical
output (ad7245900f52eaec4664d4fca8010da40e60f1795ed35d7297dfe0f835807717).
Bpfmt and whitespace checks passed. Full graph and image build pending.

Change-Id: Id028307a6271a861947f82c8ac4f748dfa3eaac7
---
 Android.bp | 14 +++++++-------
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Android.bp b/Android.bp
index 51afdc9..32b0e17 100644
--- a/Android.bp
+++ b/Android.bp
@@ -27,15 +27,15 @@ filegroup {
     srcs: ["*.xml"],
 }
 
-prebuilt_etc_xml {
+prebuilt_etc {
     name: "apns-conf.xml",
-    enabled: select(soong_config_variable("lineage_apn", "use_device_apns"), {
-        true: false,
-        default: true,
-    }),
     product_specific: true,
-    src: ":apns-conf",
-    schema: ":apns-conf-schema",
+    // The default generator validates its merged output against apns-conf-schema.
+    // Devices supplying a custom source own its XML validation.
+    src: select(soong_config_variable("lineage_apn", "custom_apns"), {
+        any @ source: source,
+        default: ":apns-conf",
+    }),
 }
 
 filegroup {
